{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20052","headline":"赠韩郎中愈 二 · 孟郊","name":"赠韩郎中愈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"硕鼠既穿墉，又啮机上丝。\n穿墉有闲土，啮丝无余衣。\n朝吟枯桑柘，暮泣空杼机。\n岂是无巧妙，丝断将何施。\n衆人尚肥华，志士多饥羸。\n愿君保此节，天意当察微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}